-Originated in voxel engine development tutorials, specifically popularized by "Make yourself a Voxel Engine THIS weekend" [S1, unofficial]. The technique is a standard optimization in voxel engines to handle dynamic geometry efficiently [S1, unofficial]. Variants with remesh budgets are used in more complex voxel games like "Survivor Builder" [S2].
